{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミス田舎もんの川後でございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜の『乃木坂ってどこ?』をご覧になった方はご存じの通り、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1田舎もんになってしまったのです、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか私がぁ！Σ(￣□￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく、田舎もんに見えないって言われてきたのに皆様にバレてしまったあ(￣▽￣;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は本当に田舎もんなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、さいきん上京しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで行っていた学校は、全校生徒の名前を言えるくらい人数が少なく、今年で廃校となってしまいます((ノ_・。))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が2年間過ごした学校がなくなってしまうなんて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すんごく寂しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私の地元は山と海に囲まれています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぬきや猿、いたち、イノシシに出くわすのは普通です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、田舎もんなんです(><)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、地元大好きなんで全然いいです(・∀・)はぁと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ、こんな田舎もんを応援してください！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin